---
/* Component — PageHeaderStart
 * The start region of the page's top bar. Carries daisyUI's own navbar-start class,
 * rented for its layout mechanics — the three regions use flex-basis sizing
 * that centres the middle child, which is why PageHeader does not reimplement
 * them.
 *
 * No styling of its own: daisyUI supplies the whole behaviour, so this is pure
 * structure.
 *
 * Order matters. The regions only lay out correctly when Start, Center and End
 * appear in that order inside PageHeader — placed otherwise the centring breaks
 * with no error. The same unenforced-ordering trade-off DisplayCardImage and
 * DisplayCardFooter carry. */
---

<div class="navbar-start">
  <slot />
</div>
